
@startuml
[*] --> Identifying 
Identifying : entry / 
Identifying : cycle / ReadIdentity()
Identifying : exit / 
Identifying --> Configuring : triggered ReadDevice/ IsCorrectIdentity()\nraise Identified
Identifying --> [*] : triggered ReadDevice/ [!IsCorrectIdentity()]\n 
state Configuring {
    Configuring : entry / 
    Configuring : cycle / 
    Configuring : exit / 
    [*] --> SampleRate

    SampleRate : entry / WriteSampleRate()
    SampleRate : cycle / 
    SampleRate : exit / 
    SampleRate --> Error : always [not status_.IsBusy() and status_.IsFailure()]\n
    SampleRate --> ScaleRange : triggered WroteDevice/ \n
    SampleRate --> Error : triggered DeviceError/ \nraise ErrorOccurred

    ScaleRange : entry / WriteScaleRange()
    ScaleRange : cycle / 
    ScaleRange : exit / 
    ScaleRange --> Error : always [not status_.IsBusy() and status_.IsFailure()]\n
    ScaleRange --> Enabled : triggered WroteDevice/ \n
    ScaleRange --> Error : triggered DeviceError/ \nraise ErrorOccurred

    Enabled : entry / WriteEnabled()
    Enabled : cycle / 
    Enabled : exit / 
    Enabled --> Error : always [not status_.IsBusy() and status_.IsFailure()]\n
    Enabled --> [*] : triggered WroteDevice/ \n
    Enabled --> Error : triggered DeviceError/ \nraise ErrorOccurred
} 
Waiting : entry / timeout_.Reset()
Waiting : cycle / 
Waiting : exit / 
Waiting --> Polling : always [timeout_.IsExpired()]\n 
Polling : entry / ReadDataReady()
Polling : cycle / 
Polling : exit / 
Polling --> Error : always [not status_.IsBusy() and status_.IsFailure()]\n
Polling --> SamplingAcceleration : triggered ReadDevice/ [DataReady()]\n
Polling --> Error : triggered DeviceError/ \nraise ErrorOccurred 
SamplingAcceleration : entry / ReadAcceleration()
SamplingAcceleration : cycle / 
SamplingAcceleration : exit / 
SamplingAcceleration --> Error : always [not status_.IsBusy() and status_.IsFailure()]\n
SamplingAcceleration --> SamplingGyroscope : triggered ReadDevice/ [MeasurementComplete()]\nraise SampledAcceleration
SamplingAcceleration --> Error : triggered DeviceError/ \nraise ErrorOccurred 
SamplingGyroscope : entry / ReadGyroscope()
SamplingGyroscope : cycle / 
SamplingGyroscope : exit / 
SamplingGyroscope --> Error : always [not status_.IsBusy() and status_.IsFailure()]\n
SamplingGyroscope --> SamplingTemperature : triggered ReadDevice/ [MeasurementComplete()]\nraise SampledGyroscope
SamplingGyroscope --> Error : triggered DeviceError/ \nraise ErrorOccurred 
SamplingTemperature : entry / ReadTemperature()
SamplingTemperature : cycle / 
SamplingTemperature : exit / 
SamplingTemperature --> Error : always [not status_.IsBusy() and status_.IsFailure()]\n
SamplingTemperature --> Waiting : triggered ReadDevice/ [MeasurementComplete()]\nraise SampledTemperature
SamplingTemperature --> Error : triggered DeviceError/ \nraise ErrorOccurred 
Error : entry / 
Error : cycle / raise ErrorOccurred
Error : exit / 
Error --> Configuring : triggered Reset/ \n
@enduml